msgstr "https://github.com/zirkeldesign/privacy-captcha-for-cap"

#. Description of the plugin
#: privacy-captcha-for-cap.php
msgid "Privacy-friendly spam protection for WordPress comments, login, registration, WooCommerce checkout, and Gravity Forms, powered by your own Cap (trycap.dev) server."
msgstr "Protection anti-spam respectueuse de la vie privée pour les commentaires, la connexion, l’inscription, la commande WooCommerce et Gravity Forms, propulsée par votre propre serveur Cap (trycap.dev)."

#. Author of the plugin
#: privacy-captcha-for-cap.php
msgid "Zirkel Design"
msgstr "Zirkel Design"

#. Author URI of the plugin
